msgstr "Hindi makumpirma ng BackupPlus na natapos ang maintenance ng credential key. Suriin ang status ng key sa Settings → Expert settings → Credential encryption."

#: includes/class-credential-key-rotation.php:195
msgid "Rotate it in the service environment configuration; WordPress cannot rotate environment-managed keys."
msgstr "I-rotate ito sa configuration ng environment ng serbisyo; hindi makapag-rotate ang WordPress ng mga key na pinamamahalaan ng environment."

#: includes/class-credential-key-rotation.php:196
