#: includes/class-multisite-restore.php:392
msgid "Could not move the new files into place. Check your wp-content/upgrade folder."
msgstr "Hindi mailagay sa tamang lugar ang mga bagong file. Suriin ang iyong folder na wp-content/upgrade."

#: includes/class-multisite-restore.php:462
